## To release a new version, edit the version in the two lines below and nothing else.
## |cRRGGBB...|r in Title and Author colours them in the in-game add-on list; the version
## is read back through that markup, so it can sit inside or outside the colour.
## Title: |cFF69B4PB’s ChatAssistant|r 3.0.0
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Opens the console chat entry box from the keyboard. Press Enter and the box opens on its own, so there is no reaching for the controller combo (Options + touchpad) between messages. Run /pbchat to set it up.
## Version: 3.0.0
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## SavedVariables: PBsChatAssistant_Data

lang/strings.lua
lang/$(language).lua

Controls.xml
Main.lua

